# Amazon dataset — supplied locally, never deployed.
#
# .gitignore does not protect these: `vercel deploy` uploads the local working
# directory, not the git tree, so without this file Vite copies
# public/amazon-products.csv into dist/ and the deployment serves the real
# dataset publicly. The source's redistribution terms have not been verified,
# and src/amazon.csv additionally holds real reviewer ids and names.
#
# Excluding it is what makes the deployed build fall back to the committed
# synthetic public/amazon-demo.csv, which is the documented behavior.
# See "Amazon dataset" in README.md.
src/amazon.csv
public/amazon-products.csv

# Design docs and local benchmark artifacts — not needed at runtime.
bench/
docs/

# Belt and braces: api/ must contain only route handlers, and tests must never
# deploy. The structural guard is test/api/routesOnly.test.ts.
api/**/*.test.ts
